{"id": "EUVD-2026-98895", "enisaUuid": "8ad382fd-606e-38d4-829d-97594b86b9ce", "description": "ThriveX-Server through 4.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the GET /api/article and /api/article/{id} endpoints that allows unauthenticated attackers to read unpublished draft and soft-deleted articles. Attackers can request sequential article ids or supply isDraft=true or isDel=true query parameters to retrieve full titles, descriptions and content of non-public articles.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:23", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:58:26", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/thrivex-server-draft-article-unauth-disclosure", "https://github.com/LiuYuYang01/ThriveX-Server/blob/4.0/blog/src/main/java/liuyuyang/net/web/service/impl/ArticleServiceImpl.java#L228-L270", "https://github.com/LiuYuYang01/ThriveX-Server/blob/4.0/blog/src/main/java/liuyuyang/net/web/service/impl/ArticleServiceImpl.java#L318-L356", "https://github.com/LiuYuYang01/ThriveX-Server/blob/4.0/blog/src/main/java/liuyuyang/net/web/controller/ArticleController.java#L82-L102", "https://github.com/LiuYuYang01/ThriveX-Server/releases/tag/4.0", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/thrivex-server-through-4.0-missing-authorization-via-article-retrieval-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110131", "GHSA-75r3-hhfq-mmwm"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "f4bff157-13f5-3d72-897c-3cd000d3121e", "product": {"name": "ThriveX-Server", "vendor": {"name": "LiuYuYang01"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22644.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "09298840-57e8-34da-890f-a2436ae82496", "vendor": {"name": "LiuYuYang01"}}], "isExploited": false}